  "caption": "Cantonese mambo big band, 1950s Pérez Prado style revival. Punchy trumpet and trombone section riffs with shouted brass hits; syncopated montuno piano; congas, timbales and cowbell driving the clave; tumbao bass; growling baritone sax underneath. Hot 1950s big-band room sound with brass up front and wide percussion. Female mezzo, bright and rhythmic, answered by brass stabs. 184 BPM, F major. Bubbly, determined and self-mocking. No reggaeton beat, no EDM, no autotune, no rock guitar, no ballad slowdown.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n四十二歲先學游水\n泳衣係上個禮拜買\n教練話身體放鬆啲\n我一放鬆就沉落底\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n手揸實塊浮板\n死都唔肯放\n\n[Chorus]\n浮唔起 浮唔起\n我似舊石頭\n浮唔起 浮唔起\n飲咗半個池嘅水\n\n[Verse]\n隔籬線個小朋友\n游過嚟又游過去\n佢阿媽喺看台揮手\n我當佢係同我打氣\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n教練叫我望天花\n數到十先郁\n\n[Chorus]\n浮唔起 浮唔起\n天花有十二盞燈\n浮唔起 浮唔起\n我數到七就飲水\n\n[Verse]\n第六堂嗰日落微雨\n泳池得返我一個\n我望住天花慢慢數\n耳仔入面好靜好靜\n\n[Bridge]\n數到十 我先發覺\n塊浮板喺教練手度\n\n[Chorus]\n浮得起 浮得起\n原來佢早就放手\n浮得起 浮得起\n我成個人笑到沉咗落去\n\n[Outro]\n下堂學換氣\n教練你唔好走",
